var description_default47 = "Change your durable memory. write saves a fact (deduped); forget drops one by its exact recorded text (find it with RecallMemory), so pair it with a write to correct a fact. Save without asking and mention it in passing. Routines have their own UpdateRoutine tool. Skills, profile and settings, picture, and channels have their own tools in the cursor namespace: UpdateSkill, UpdateProfile, UpdateAvatar, DisconnectChannel.\n";

